0..74 Comment "//! Univalence at the corollas of a magma\'s signature, written by hand and"
75..118 Comment "//! checked against the derived `ua[1, 4]`."
119..122 Comment "//!"
123..198 Comment "//! The hand definition shows what `ua` builds: reflexivity at the unit for"
199..274 Comment "//! the empty shape, then one `equiv` per corolla, nested to the right. Its"
275..350 Comment "//! directed twin is the same shape for flows, one `Flow.into` per corolla."
351..354 Comment "//!"
355..429 Comment "//! The module states the hand path beside the derived one and checks that"
430..505 Comment "//! they convert. Transport and a ride along each move the binary corolla\'s"
506..565 Comment "//! boolean. A ride that would reverse the flow is refused."
566..569 Comment "//!"
570..643 Comment "//! - see: `pathological/higher-cells/ua-by-hand-unnatural.gandr` — the"
644..699 Comment "//!   naturality `ua` checks beyond the hand definition"
700..780 Comment "//! - see: `ua-corolla-strata.gandr` — the Segal certification from degree two"
781..856 Comment "//! - cites: [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]"
857..936 Comment "//! - cites: [Gratzer-2026-directed_univalence_simplicial_homotopy_type_theory]"
937..940 Comment "//!"
941..1117 Comment "//! [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]: https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129514000565 \"Shulman, Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity\""
1118..1314 Comment "//! [Gratzer-2026-directed_univalence_simplicial_homotopy_type_theory]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.09146 \"Gratzer, Weinberger and Buchholtz, Directed univalence in simplicial homotopy type theory\""
